{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11211870","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211870","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1121187001:0":{"text":"醜くあがく、愚か者どもが！真の美学は凡俗に埋もれはしない、決して……","source_cn":"如此挣扎，如此愚昧！真正的美学绝不会被庸俗淹没，绝不会……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21ACA86D0C5C0860","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121187002:0":{"text":"醜悪な神の創造物よ、今しばらく生きながらえるがいい……いつの日か必ず、私の手で、真の芸術を大陸に行き渡らせてみせます！","source_cn":"就让粗俗丑恶的神明造物再苟延残喘一阵子吧，总有一日，真...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFA7D2182138CE0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:6:1121188001:":{"text":"待ちなさい、カタストロフ！","source_cn":"——站住，恶魔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x494B3C05A5390E49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121187003:1":{"text":"空間魔法……逃げられたか。","source_cn":"空间法术……他逃了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C0C959C27DB4336","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121187004:1":{"text":"タレン様、あのカタストロフは……また戻ってくるでしょうか？","source_cn":"塔琳殿下，那个恶魔……他还会回来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8FA05D1D6E1B1BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121187005:1":{"text":"心配しないで。あいつは私が必ず追い詰めて、代償を払わせてやるわ。","source_cn":"不必担心。我会追击他，让他接受裁决，付出应有的代价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x241325E5AFEB4C85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1121187006:1":{"text":"それが、セレスチアルである私の責任だから。","source_cn":"这是身为半神的责任。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CDF818DDF712064","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1121187006":{"text":"それが、セレスチアルである私の責任だから。","source_cn":"这是身为半神的责任。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CDF818DDF712064","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121187007:1":{"text":"ええ、一刻も無駄にはできないから。","source_cn":"我得尽快动身，不能耽搁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06EEEAD9E3E606E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1121187008:1":{"text":"あなたにはあなたの使命がある……きっと、辛い旅路になると思うけど……","source_cn":"你也有自己肩负的使命……我想，那必将是一段艰险的旅程吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE44E6A1556D28934","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あなたにはあなたの使命がある……きっと、辛い旅路になると思うけど……","female":"あなたにはあなたの使命がある……きっと、辛い旅路になると思うけど……","variant_male_record_index":"101354","variant_female_record_index":"101355","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"",